<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to tender $250 mln Letes T-bills Dec 17.</title>
<headline>Argentina to tender $250 mln Letes T-bills Dec 17.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will tender $250 million in 91-day letes T-bills December 17, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>The Letes will be placed in a Dutch Auction.  </p>
<p>In its last auction, Argentina placed 250 million pesos in 91-day Letes November 12 at a cut-off yield of 7.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
